13.4.1 Analytical results should be appropriately and accurately reported. Such
reports should include but not necessarily be limited to the following:
a) Identification of the analytical work by unique identification number. b) The clinical trial number. c) Identity of the Sponsor. d) Identity of the trial facilities and the Investigator to whom the results
are directed. e) Name of the Analytical Project Manager.

